    "Single seed: occlusion improves EAA/DC by 1.4659/2.6074 pp over the matched augmented control.",
    "Dark improves 0.1589/0.1331 pp; blur changes -0.5272/+0.2869 pp, so results do not establish an improvement under every degradation.",
